  You may use the Tail Attack Maneuver, but your Profile for that Attacking Maneuver is Powered.
text: >
  (5)-[1/Encounter]: You may use the Tail Attack Maneuver, but your Profile for that Attacking Maneuver is Powered.
  –Maneuver Type: Instant Maneuver
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –KP Cost: N/A (the Tail Attack's)
  –Effect: The Tail Attack Maneuver, of the Powered Profile.

